🇺🇸🇨🇳 On the US-Nvidia Political Circus

▪️An actual, real spy investigation would neither be leaked to major Western propaganda platforms (who work directly with intelligence agencies to shape narratives in the first place) nor be reported by them until the investigation was concluded and actions already taken;

▪️Instead, "leaks" like this are used to organize deliberate political circus meant to manipulate the public, pressure China in this case, and possibly even pressure or seize control of aspects of Nvidia's operations by targeting its senior leadership;

▪️There is something revealing here regarding the US corporate oligarchy using its power to command/control and pressure individual corporations - not to take actions to serve the American people's best interests, but to serve the collective greed of the larger corporate oligarchy itself, while "fighting Communist China" who is "evil" specifically because it commands and controls corporations to actually serve the best interests of the people;

